{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"当创建附加创意类型为游戏礼包码的营销计划，且游戏礼包的 `download_url` 为新链接时，使用该接口提交包解析任务，可解析出 APP 相关信息。提交任务后，可使用【查询包解析状态】接口查询状态，查询到 `package_status` 为 `\\\"SUCCESS\\\"` 后，方可提交创建营销计划。\",\"id\":\"ad.package.parse\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/download/package/parse/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1696710744089612\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.package.parse_status.query\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"提交解析应用包任务后，需要使用该接口查询包解析状态\",\"relation\":\"后置接口\",\"title\":\"查询包解析状态\"},{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"调用本接口需要先获取授权access-token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.reference\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"本接口的返回码和返回信息说明参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1696710744089612\",\"title\":\"提交解析应用包任务\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5ZaG4AoH\">当您需要创建一个附加创意类型为游戏礼包码的营销计划时，如果该游戏礼包的<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">download_url</span></code>为未在字节的营销系统中上传或使用过的新<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">download_url</span></code>，则需要使用该接口提交包解析任务。<br/>使用提交解析应用包任务时，您只需要传入参数<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">advertiser_id</span></code>和该游戏礼包的<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">download_url</span></code>，即可解析出APP相关信息（包名、appname、icon等），这些信息将在礼包码原生转化卡中展示。<br/>提交解析应用包任务后，您可以使用<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【查询包解析状态】</a>接口对当前包解析状态进行查询。查询到返回参数<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">package_status</span></code>为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">SUCCESS</span>\"</code>后，方可提交创建营销计划。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201779529060385800%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-iBreFQ4j\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-5s5KNzzk\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/download/package/parse/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/download/package/parse/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710744089612\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-VK8qhkhU\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-UuZGm0pV\">POST</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-056YsAEG\" id=\"link-2\">Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t1e39d7f-eFAhzLPR\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-i